; Run 3 on OPS-SAT PRETTY (exp4051), version 2, segment 1: the shrinking
; quorum with each replica in a process of its own, replicas 0 and 1 on
; different cores. The faults of run 1, as in version 1, except the kill:
;   cycle  60  one bit flip in replica 2's computation (FaultInjector)
;   cycle 120  replica 1 returns the same wrong value (FaultInjector):
;              outvoted three times, fails its known-answer test, retired
;   cycle 240  replica 0's process is killed with SIGKILL at the start of
;              the cycle (by the manager process, `-k kill:0@240` in run):
;              a real crash; lost after three silent cycles; replica 2
;              goes on alone in self-check
; SET_UPSETS sets no random upsets and seed 1, the demo's seed.
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.manager.SET_POLICY SHRINK
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.injector.SET_UPSETS 0.0 0.05 1
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.injector.INJECT CORRUPT 2 60
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.injector.INJECT STUCK 1 120
